WEBVTT

NOTE Video ID: vYKQKY3Rrfo

NOTE Language: en

00:00:06.009 --> 00:00:10.821
This joy is for you to share it with others.

00:00:11.022 --> 00:00:16.768
Unless and until you learn that, your
ego will come back again and again.

00:00:16.969 --> 00:00:21.797
And also you have seen the way

00:00:21.998 --> 00:00:28.220
people who have been even spreading
Sahaja Yoga got into the mess of ego.

00:00:28.421 --> 00:00:34.024
So one has to be very careful. The
more you are rising in your divinity,

00:00:34.225 --> 00:00:38.881
the more you are maturing, you have to be very careful.

00:00:39.082 --> 00:00:46.402
See on a tree if you see, if there’s a leaf, no insect will enter.

00:00:46.603 --> 00:00:52.190
If there’s a flower, the insect will
come and it will make it into a fruit.

00:00:52.391 --> 00:00:58.394
But when it is a fruit, then the insect will enter and eat it off.

00:00:58.595 --> 00:01:01.864
So when you are becoming a fruit, you have to be very careful

00:01:02.065 --> 00:01:05.058
that no insect should get into you.

00:01:05.259 --> 00:01:11.484
On the contrary, now you have
[the] capacity to destroy all the insects.

00:01:11.692 --> 00:01:19.591
And that is what is, I would say, is the
state where we should all come up to.

00:01:19.821 --> 00:01:22.151
So you are destroying insects on one side

00:01:22.352 --> 00:01:26.539
and satisfying people on the other side.

00:01:26.887 --> 00:01:33.261
Collectivity is, of course no doubt,
is the only way you can be cleansed;

00:01:33.462 --> 00:01:36.948
but the greater thing is to go out, all out, to find out,

00:01:37.149 --> 00:01:40.189
“Where can I spread Sahaja Yoga? Where can I go?

00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:44.432
What is the nearest village I can go? Where will I work it out?”

00:01:44.633 --> 00:01:47.988
All those things the more you think, the better it is,

00:01:48.189 --> 00:01:52.655
and you start moving in that direction.

00:01:52.856 --> 00:01:55.404
Once you start moving in that direction, you will be surprised

00:01:55.605 --> 00:01:58.558
Sahaja Yoga will move ahead of you.

00:01:58.759 --> 00:02:01.518
You’ll meet the people whom you want,

00:02:01.719 --> 00:02:06.761
you’ll get all the necessary help that you want,

00:02:06.962 --> 00:02:10.026
suddenly you’ll find some people who will come down

00:02:10.227 --> 00:02:14.452
and say, “Now, what can we do for you?”

00:02:14.653 --> 00:02:20.160
Every type of help starts coming to you the way you expand yourself.

00:02:20.361 --> 00:02:25.880
It’s like the expanding your wings, like a bird does,

00:02:26.081 --> 00:02:32.951
and then you take off. But if you don’t extend yourself,

00:02:33.191 --> 00:02:39.190
you keep Sahaja Yoga to yourself only, it doesn’t work.

00:02:40.564 --> 00:02:44.621
I know you love me very much and you know I love you very much,

00:02:44.822 --> 00:02:50.770
but don’t you think others should also share this love,

00:02:50.971 --> 00:02:54.481
others should also have this?

00:02:54.682 --> 00:02:59.420
Now when we start struggling, we also struggle with people

00:02:59.621 --> 00:03:04.584
who are very difficult - like “my brother, my brother’s son...”

00:03:04.785 --> 00:03:10.873
Just don’t go near my, get away. My is the most difficult thing.

00:03:11.074 --> 00:03:15.537
You see, in my family, I don’t touch them

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:18.498
because once you go to my they sit on your heads,

00:03:18.699 --> 00:03:24.191
or maybe they’ll sit on the heads of
the Sahaja Yogis or something, nothing.

00:03:24.392 --> 00:03:27.111
So don’t go to the people – “it is my sister,

00:03:27.312 --> 00:03:30.369
she is my sister-in-law”, nothing of the kind.

00:03:30.570 --> 00:03:36.160
What you have to do is to see what is beyond

00:03:36.361 --> 00:03:40.740
and the more you’ll go beyond, the better it will be.

00:03:42.281 --> 00:03:45.313
See, you can see clearly, we’ve worked so hard in Maharashtra,

00:03:45.514 --> 00:03:50.985
it is a useless place I find. Maharashtrian
Sahaja Yogis are few, very few,

00:03:51.186 --> 00:03:54.607
but whatever are there are also not so good.

00:03:54.808 --> 00:03:58.619
While Delhi Sahaja Yogis, now here in Madras, in Bangalore,

00:03:58.820 --> 00:04:02.999
see what nice Sahaja Yogis are there.

00:04:04.121 --> 00:04:07.670
So much work I have done there.

00:04:07.959 --> 00:04:14.189
So those who are very near to you,
always cannot see the greatness of you.

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:19.861
Like if you go near the big mountain, you cannot see the big mountain,

00:04:20.062 --> 00:04:23.055
you have to be away and then you see. In the same way,

00:04:23.256 --> 00:04:26.219
when you want to do some work with anyone,

00:04:26.420 --> 00:04:29.662
try to see that you are not closely related,

00:04:29.863 --> 00:04:34.436
nor do you have any connections with them. Something unknown.

00:04:34.637 --> 00:04:37.867
These people are much better for you to follow

00:04:38.068 --> 00:04:43.169
and they will keep your attention tight, absolutely on you.

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:48.426
Otherwise, the people who are known to you will trouble you.

00:04:48.627 --> 00:04:51.710
Now there are many difficulties in spreading Sahaja Yoga -

00:04:51.911 --> 00:04:57.754
there were many, many more before, slowly these are coming down.

00:04:57.955 --> 00:05:02.124
Naturally, it is much better than at the time of Thomas [the Apostle]

00:05:02.325 --> 00:05:06.350
because he had to hide his treatise to save it from others.

00:05:06.551 --> 00:05:09.730
He thought a day will come when there will be resurrection time,

00:05:09.931 --> 00:05:13.591
then this treatise would be [revealed]. Imagine, only 48 years back,

00:05:13.792 --> 00:05:19.167
now it would be around 53 or 50 years back, it was discovered.

00:05:20.711 --> 00:05:25.965
It was not discovered before. He had to hide it.

00:05:26.166 --> 00:05:28.559
But now we are not to hide.

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:33.910
We are to go all out and must know, must forgive.

00:05:34.111 --> 00:05:39.071
That, you see, ours is an open place where anybody can come in.

00:05:39.272 --> 00:05:41.733
So we get all kinds of people - if you go and meet people,

00:05:41.934 --> 00:05:47.553
also there is all kinds of oppositions,
all these things, doesn’t matter.

00:05:47.754 --> 00:05:52.137
Everything can be overcome, but first is your own initiative

00:05:52.338 --> 00:05:56.898
and your own lethargy which has to be overcome.

00:05:59.512 --> 00:06:01.664
Then it will start spreading out.

00:06:01.865 --> 00:06:04.800
Of course, we have already lot of Sahaja Yogis -

00:06:05.001 --> 00:06:08.903
in Russia, if you see, we have so many, in thousands.

00:06:09.104 --> 00:06:13.262
But in every place we can have lots of people now

00:06:13.463 --> 00:06:17.756
and I’m sure this is a nice year where they say so, predict

00:06:17.957 --> 00:06:20.870
that Sahaja Yoga will grow very much this year.

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:24.218
So this is the beginning we are starting today.

00:06:24.434 --> 00:06:27.409
I just wanted to tell you that you have the power,

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:31.360
you have the shakti within your reach.

00:06:31.561 --> 00:06:36.934
They said it was very cold one day before I came here,

00:06:37.135 --> 00:06:40.477
I said, “Don’t worry.” I didn’t give bandhan or anything.

00:06:40.678 --> 00:06:46.224
I just came here and how they know!

00:06:46.425 --> 00:06:50.623
It’s become all right, you are sitting in your kurta pyjamas.

00:06:50.824 --> 00:06:56.072
Otherwise, you would have been in your three-piece suits shivering.

00:06:56.273 --> 00:07:01.849
That’s how it works. But you have to be that way dedicated.

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:06.453
Now for all these: Surya [sun] and Chandra [moon]

00:07:06.654 --> 00:07:13.529
and all these stars and the whole cosmos has only one thing to do -

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:19.891
is to see that Sahaja Yoga is spreading well,

00:07:20.092 --> 00:07:25.307
is settling well and is achieving its goal.

00:07:27.270 --> 00:07:30.248
Every element is working it out.

00:07:30.449 --> 00:07:35.219
Everything is working - this Paramchaitanya
is working around in so many ways.

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:37.849
You are not to be convinced about me, I know.

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:40.361
But now you have to be convinced about yourself

00:07:40.442 --> 00:07:43.750
that you have all the powers within you.

00:07:43.951 --> 00:07:47.124
I mean, I don’t do anything really, to be very frank.

00:07:47.325 --> 00:07:51.890
If I could do everything, I would not
have had you, I would have done it myself.

00:07:52.091 --> 00:07:55.284
But you have to do it - you are my channels.

00:07:55.485 --> 00:08:00.754
You are the channels of Shakti. But do it in a way which is gracious,

00:08:00.955 --> 00:08:04.705
which is beautiful, which is very satisfying.

00:08:04.906 --> 00:08:10.473
Like yesterday, that musician - he just wanted to entertain you.

00:08:10.674 --> 00:08:16.670
He wanted to play. I mean, he was enjoying it.

00:08:16.871 --> 00:08:23.114
In the same way, we should want to do it. I don’t have to tell you.

00:08:23.315 --> 00:08:28.541
And I am sure, in every area that you work,

00:08:28.742 --> 00:08:32.876
in every personality whom you meet,

00:08:33.077 --> 00:08:36.550
you can start talking about Sahaja Yoga and tell them.

00:08:36.751 --> 00:08:40.140
It works. It acts.

00:08:40.341 --> 00:08:45.455
Moreover, it is behind you the whole power of all the deities,

00:08:45.656 --> 00:08:49.704
and in front is Sahaja Yoga running forward fast, this Paramchaitanya:

00:08:49.905 --> 00:08:52.196
“Now the Sahaja Yogis are coming, all right,

00:08:52.397 --> 00:08:58.083
let them not eat their food, finished” - organising.

00:08:58.337 --> 00:09:02.261
Everything so beautifully done. Now see the arrangements and all -

00:09:02.476 --> 00:09:07.961
I mean, I was thinking such few people
here, and about 20 Sahaja Yogis in Madras -

00:09:08.162 --> 00:09:12.390
can you believe it, all this arrangement?

00:09:13.179 --> 00:09:20.917
How it’s working out, how it is
giving results, it’s really remarkable.

00:09:21.911 --> 00:09:26.889
So have faith in yourself, have faith in all of them helping you,

00:09:27.090 --> 00:09:30.309
not to be nervous and just go ahead.

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:35.115
Because the shakti is in you. You have the power.

00:09:35.316 --> 00:09:39.344
Every kind of power you have, I assure you, you have every power.

00:09:39.545 --> 00:09:41.574
Ask for it and you’ll have it.

00:09:41.775 --> 00:09:44.307
Whatever you ask for it, it will happen.

00:09:44.508 --> 00:09:51.774
But don’t hesitate. As I said the other
day, that I make you sit on the throne,

00:09:51.975 --> 00:09:55.820
then also I put the crown on your head.

00:09:56.021 --> 00:10:02.952
And also I say, “Now you are the king,” but still you are running away

00:10:03.153 --> 00:10:06.422
and not believing me - looking this side with fear –

00:10:06.623 --> 00:10:09.773
“Am I a king really? How can I be?”

00:10:09.974 --> 00:10:13.273
That’s not the way. Have faith in yourself.